OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry, bright start, but soon
OL,6,Fclouding over with a chance of rain,
OL,7,Fpossibly including heavier bursts at
OL,8,Ftimes moving eastwards. Rain clearing
OL,9,Fby early to mid-afternoon bringing
OL,10,Fwidespread warm sunshine to the region
OL,11,Fbut also some locally gusty winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FFine this evening for many
OL,14,Fthough rather breezy in places and
OL,15,Ffeeling fairly humid. Cloud and patchy
OL,16,Frain spreads southeast overnight,
OL,17,Falthough some places could stay dry
OL,18,Fthroughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
