OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FLargely dry and bright on
OL,6,FMonday but becoming widely breezy.
OL,7,FBands of rain and showers,
OL,8,Foccasionally heavy, pushing across the
OL,9,Farea through the evening and overnight
OL,10,Fperiod.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FSunny
OL,13,Fspells and scattered blustery showers
OL,14,FTuesday. Wednesday, mainly dry and
OL,15,Fbright with lighter winds then
OL,16,Fpotentially turning wet and rather
OL,17,Fwindy on Thursday. Temperatures around
OL,18,Faverage for early September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
